## to run!" — kept aside; the dress and hat need their own.

define phrase change-outfit
  (TODO during play-testing — Jack changes into the dress and the fashionable
  hat behind the stall; the cap goes into the satchel.)
end phrase

define phrase change-no-dress
  (TODO during play-testing — Nothing to change into yet.)
